00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:45.560
Sprint, just like many other
telecommunications companies,

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:47.270
they offer a lot of
services and products

00:11:47.270 --> 00:11:49.850
to their customers for
mobile communications.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:52.310
The switching costs
for a customer

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.290
to switch from one
telecommunications company

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:56.900
to another are
actually very low now.

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.640
So what that means
