00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:02.300
to compete very hard to
keep their customers happy

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:03.770
and show the value.

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:05.660
And so Sprint's
marketing team was

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.610
challenged with trying
to keep and retain

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:09.807
more of their customers.

00:12:09.807 --> 00:12:11.390
So what they did is
they actually they

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:14.120
joined together two of their
teams, their analytics team

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:16.010
and their marketing
team, and had

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:17.870
